A field that holds a value built from the same field: each push wraps what the
field held. The location is not unrolled to the chain depth: while it is
solved, a load of it stands for the leaves of its values, so the Wrap is added
once, over "any value of the field under any number of Wraps": the entries
marked chain may repeat. (A push on a stack whose field is still nil wraps
nothing: the Opaque Error.)
